<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>教程 on QiYue's Blog</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/categories/%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/</link><description>Recent content in 教程 on QiYue's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>&amp;copy; 2026 QiYue's Blog</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/categories/%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>博客配置Twikoo评论系统</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AEtwikoo%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/</link><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AEtwikoo%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;一、创建 MongoDB 免费数据库&#10; &lt;div id="一创建-mongodb-免费数据库" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e4%b8%80%e5%88%9b%e5%bb%ba-mongodb-%e5%85%8d%e8%b4%b9%e6%95%b0%e6%8d%ae%e5%ba%93" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;打开：&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AEtwikoo%E8%AF%84%E8%AE%BA%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/featured.png"/></item><item><title>ElasticSearch学习</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/elasticsearch%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/</link><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 10:50:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/elasticsearch%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/</guid><description>&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;数据格式&#10; &lt;div id="数据格式" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e6%95%b0%e6%8d%ae%e6%a0%bc%e5%bc%8f" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Elasticsearch 是面向文档型的数据库，一条数据在这里就是一个文档。es里面的概念和关系型数据库中的概念比对如下，可以依此进行理解：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>用 Pages CMS + Hugo + GitHub Pages 搭一套免费可视化博客</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/%E7%94%A8-pages-cms-+-hugo-+-github-pages-%E6%90%AD%E4%B8%80%E5%A5%97%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%B9%E5%8F%AF%E8%A7%86%E5%8C%96%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2/</link><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/%E7%94%A8-pages-cms-+-hugo-+-github-pages-%E6%90%AD%E4%B8%80%E5%A5%97%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%B9%E5%8F%AF%E8%A7%86%E5%8C%96%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2/</guid><description>&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;1. 前置准备&#10; &lt;div id="1-前置准备" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#1-%e5%89%8d%e7%bd%ae%e5%87%86%e5%a4%87" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;需要：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Git进阶宝典</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/git%E8%BF%9B%E9%98%B6%E5%AE%9D%E5%85%B8/</link><pubDate>Thu, 27 Jan 2022 23:07:43 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/git%E8%BF%9B%E9%98%B6%E5%AE%9D%E5%85%B8/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;在 Git 专题的开篇，我就提醒大家一定要记住这几个专用名词，对掌握 Git 有很大的帮助：&#10;Workspace：工作区&#10;Index / Stage：暂存区&#10;Repository：仓库区（或本地仓库）&#10;Remote：远程仓库&#10;当然了，没记住的话，也不要紧了，今天就趁机再温故一遍。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Flink安装部署</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/flink%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2/</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 Nov 2021 22:49:52 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/flink%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2/</guid><description>&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;下载&#10; &lt;div id="下载" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e4%b8%8b%e8%bd%bd" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;div&#10; class="tab__container w-full"&#10; &#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab__nav" role="tablist"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1"&gt;&lt;button&#10; class="tab__button px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold border-b-2 border-transparent rounded-t-md hover:bg-neutral-200 dark:hover:bg-neutral-700 tab--active"&#10; role="tab"&#10; aria-selected="true"&#10; data-tab-index="0"&#10; data-tab-label="Windows"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="flex items-center gap-1"&gt;&#10; &#10; Windows&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&lt;button&#10; class="tab__button px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold border-b-2 border-transparent rounded-t-md hover:bg-neutral-200 dark:hover:bg-neutral-700 "&#10; role="tab"&#10; aria-selected="false"&#10; data-tab-index="1"&#10; data-tab-label="Linux"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="flex items-center gap-1"&gt;&#10; &#10; Linux&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="tab__content mt-4"&gt;&lt;div class="tab__panel tab--active" data-tab-index="0"&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;下载&#10; &lt;div id="下载" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e4%b8%8b%e8%bd%bd" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;要想运行flink，前提必须安装 JDK1.8x&#10;官网下载地址：&lt;code&gt;https://flink.apache.org/zh/downloads.html&lt;/code&gt;。或者百度云下载：&lt;a href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1MXBwNuC-_y8tIqaEWCY1og" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;链接&lt;/a&gt; 提取码: &lt;code&gt;jw3e&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>MySQL函数-存储过程-索引学习</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/mysql%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0-%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B-%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 Nov 2021 14:48:14 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/mysql%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0-%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E8%BF%87%E7%A8%8B-%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;在自己的个人项目中，我们可能会需要在表中随机生成一些数据以供我们进行相应的测试。这时候就可以通过存储过程来向表中添加规定条数的数据。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Difference between FileReader vs FileInputStream in Java</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/difference-between-filereader-vs-fileinputstream-in-java/</link><pubDate>Mon, 25 Oct 2021 18:14:33 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/difference-between-filereader-vs-fileinputstream-in-java/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Difference between FileReader vs FileInputStream in Java? Answer&#10;Even though both FileReader and FileInputStream are used to read data from a file in Java, they are quite different. The main difference between the FileReader and FileInputStream is that one reads data from a character stream while the other reads data from a byte stream. The FileReader automatically converts the raw bytes into characters by using the platform&amp;rsquo;s default character encoding. This means you should use this class if you are reading from a text file that has the same character encoding as the default one.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>网络编程模式学习</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Jun 2021 08:17:40 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/</guid><description>&lt;div&#10; &#10; class="flex px-4 py-3 rounded-md shadow" style="background-color: #e63946"&#10; &#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;span&#10; &#10; class="pe-3 flex items-center" style="color: #1d3557"&#10; &#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;span class="relative block icon"&gt;&lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512"&gt;&#10;&lt;path fill="currentColor" d="M159.3 5.4c7.8-7.3 19.9-7.2 27.7 .1c27.6 25.9 53.5 53.8 77.7 84c11-14.4 23.5-30.1 37-42.9c7.9-7.4 20.1-7.4 28 .1c34.6 33 63.9 76.6 84.5 118c20.3 40.8 33.8 82.5 33.8 111.9C448 404.2 348.2 512 224 512C98.4 512 0 404.1 0 276.5c0-38.4 17.8-85.3 45.4-131.7C73.3 97.7 112.7 48.6 159.3 5.4zM225.7 416c25.3 0 47.7-7 68.8-21c42.1-29.4 53.4-88.2 28.1-134.4c-2.8-5.6-5.6-11.2-9.8-16.8l-50.6 58.8s-81.4-103.6-87.1-110.6C133.1 243.8 112 273.2 112 306.8C112 375.4 162.6 416 225.7 416z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;span&#10; &#10; style="color: #f1faee"&#10; &#10; &gt;&#10;&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;Java共支持三种网络编程模式：BIO，NIO，AIO&#10; &lt;div id="java共支持三种网络编程模式bionioaio" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#java%e5%85%b1%e6%94%af%e6%8c%81%e4%b8%89%e7%a7%8d%e7%bd%91%e7%bb%9c%e7%bc%96%e7%a8%8b%e6%a8%a1%e5%bc%8fbionioaio" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div&#10; &#10; class="flex px-4 py-3 rounded-md shadow bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900"&#10; &#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;span&#10; &#10; class="text-primary-400 pe-3 flex items-center"&#10; &#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;span class="relative block icon"&gt;&lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512"&gt;&lt;path fill="currentColor" d="M459.37 151.716c.325 4.548.325 9.097.325 13.645 0 138.72-105.583 298.558-298.558 298.558-59.452 0-114.68-17.219-161.137-47.106 8.447.974 16.568 1.299 25.34 1.299 49.055 0 94.213-16.568 130.274-44.832-46.132-.975-84.792-31.188-98.112-72.772 6.498.974 12.995 1.624 19.818 1.624 9.421 0 18.843-1.3 27.614-3.573-48.081-9.747-84.143-51.98-84.143-102.985v-1.299c13.969 7.797 30.214 12.67 47.431 13.319-28.264-18.843-46.781-51.005-46.781-87.391 0-19.492 5.197-37.36 14.294-52.954 51.655 63.675 129.3 105.258 216.365 109.807-1.624-7.797-2.599-15.918-2.599-24.04 0-57.828 46.782-104.934 104.934-104.934 30.213 0 57.502 12.67 76.67 33.137 23.715-4.548 46.456-13.32 66.599-25.34-7.798 24.366-24.366 44.833-46.132 57.827 21.117-2.273 41.584-8.122 60.426-16.243-14.292 20.791-32.161 39.308-52.628 54.253z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;span&#10; &#10; class="dark:text-neutral-300"&#10; &#10; &gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;三种IO模式适用场景&#10; &lt;div id="三种io模式适用场景" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e4%b8%89%e7%a7%8dio%e6%a8%a1%e5%bc%8f%e9%80%82%e7%94%a8%e5%9c%ba%e6%99%af" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;BIO方式适用于连接数目比较小且固定的架构，这种方式对服务器资源要求比较高，并发有局限性，JDK1.4以前是唯一的选择，好处是编码实现方式简单，且也容易理解。&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;NIO方式适用于连接数目多且连接比较段的架构，比如聊天服务器，弹幕系统等，相比BIO编码较复杂，JDK1.4以后开始支持。&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;AIO方式适用于连接数据多且连接较长的场景，比如相册服务器等，编程较复杂，JDK1.7才开始支持。目前好像并为得到广泛使用。&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;BIO(blocking I/O) 基本介绍&#10; &lt;div id="bioblocking-io-基本介绍" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#bioblocking-io-%e5%9f%ba%e6%9c%ac%e4%bb%8b%e7%bb%8d" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Java BIO是传统的Java io编程，相关的类和接口在java.io包中&#10;Java BIO：同步阻塞，一个连接为一个线程，连接一个客户端就需要启动一个线程进行处理，如果连接未断开且未做任何事，会造会不必要的开销。可以通过线程池优化。&#10;Java BIO：适用于连接数目较小且相对固定的架构，对服务器的要求比较高，对并发有局限性。JDK1.4以前唯一的选择，简单易理解。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Git-commit-中添加表情</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/git-commit-%E4%B8%AD%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E8%A1%A8%E6%83%85/</link><pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2020 09:23:43 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/git-commit-%E4%B8%AD%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E8%A1%A8%E6%83%85/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;git commit 中使用表情&#10; &lt;div id="git-commit-中使用表情" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#git-commit-%e4%b8%ad%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8%e8%a1%a8%e6%83%85" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;我们经常可以在github上看到国外大佬的commit信息中有很多可爱的表情，这是怎么做到的呢？&#10;ok，可以这样使用哦：&lt;code&gt;git commit -m '提交信息 :emoji:'&lt;/code&gt;，示例：&lt;code&gt;git commit -m '增加新功能 :sparkles:'&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>GitHub上传大文件</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/github%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E5%A4%A7%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F/</link><pubDate>Mon, 30 Dec 2019 05:17:52 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/github%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E5%A4%A7%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;github上传文件限制&#10; &lt;div id="github上传文件限制" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#github%e4%b8%8a%e4%bc%a0%e6%96%87%e4%bb%b6%e9%99%90%e5%88%b6" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;github默认地上传文件限制是不超过100M，注意：是单个文件不能超过100M(注意：本篇的密码必须是SHA256加密后的密文)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Java中使用HSSFWorkbook生成Excel</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/java%E4%B8%AD%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8hssfworkbook%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90excel/</link><pubDate>Tue, 12 Nov 2019 22:14:11 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/java%E4%B8%AD%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8hssfworkbook%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90excel/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="low"&#10; alt=""&#10; src="https://img.imgdb.cn/item/604b7e335aedab222ce6192e.jpg"&#10; &gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;HSSFWorkbook 介绍&#10; &lt;div id="hssfworkbook-介绍" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#hssfworkbook-%e4%bb%8b%e7%bb%8d" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;开发中经常会遇到 Excel 的处理，在 Java 中，操作 excel 目前有两个主流框架，分别是：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>